{"work_id":"raja-rani","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/raja-rani/scenes/scene-011.md","record_count":32,"records":[{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d001","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"வேலை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"(சாந்தம்மாளிடம்) அம்மா! அய்யா என்ன ஒரு மாதிரியா பயித்தியம் மாதிரி ஒளர்ராரு? காலையிலியே எதாவது...உம்","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":25,"printed_page":24}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d002","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஹி...ஹி! அப்படி யெல்லாம் ஒண்ணுமில்லேடா! என்னா விஷயம்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":25,"printed_page":24}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d003","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"வேலை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இல்லே; பாக்கி வசூல் பண்ணிக்கிட்டு வரச் சொன்னாரு. 300 ரூபா வாங்கியாந்து கொடுக்கப் போனேன், அதை பூ இங்கிராரு; மொட்டுங்கிறாரு; மாலையாக்கட்டி படத்துக்கு போடுங்கிறாரு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d004","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஓகோ! விஷயம் இருக்கு; எவ்வளவுடா பணம் இருக்கு?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d005","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"வேலை","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"முந்நூறு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d006","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கொண்டா இங்கே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d007","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அத்தான்! எனக்கு நீங்க 200 ரூபாய் கொடுக்கலையா ரெண்டு மொழம் கயிறுகூடவா கிடைக்காம போயிடும்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d008","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம். நீ திரிக்கிற கயிறு 2 முழம் என்ன: 20 கூட கெடைக்கும்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d009","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அத்தான். நீங்க கொடுக்கலே...?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d010","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்ன செய்வே?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d011","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கழுத்திலே துணியைச் சுற்றி இப்படியே இழுத்திடுவேன், தெரியுமா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d012","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"நல்லதுதான்! இழு, இழு. நெரம்புக்கு நல்லது!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d013","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அத்தான்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d014","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"உம்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d015","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இழுத்திடுவேன், அத்தான்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d016","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இழு இழு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d017","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அத்தான், அத்தான்...!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d018","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"(அங்கு வந்து) தம்பீ...தம்பீ! இந்த மாலையைப் போட்டுக்கடா! (பணத்தை மாலையாகக் கட்டிப் போடுகிறாள்.)","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d019","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அடே பணத்தை...என்னாது? என்னாது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d020","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"இது புது தினுசு பூமாலை?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d021","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பூமாலையா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d022","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ, ஆ! அத்தான், இந்த மாலைக்காகத்தான் நான் இவ்வளவு நேரம் காத்துகிட்டு இருந்தேன், தெரியுமா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d023","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"தம்பீ! அதிலே 200 பூ இருக்கு, அந்த மாலையை தியேட்டர்காரரு கழுத்திலே போட்டுடு!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d024","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"டேய், வா இங்கே! பிடிடா இதை, பிடியிடா இதை பணத்தோட அருமை தெரியாமே அதை மாலையா கட்டுறீங்க! போ.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d025","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"பாபு","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வர்ரேன்த்தான்! இதுவா செவந்திப்பூ? இதுவா மொட்டு? வர்ரேன் அத்தான், வர்ரேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":27,"printed_page":26}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d026","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னங்க, அது?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":27,"printed_page":26}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d027","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"போயி...அதை...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":27,"printed_page":26}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d028","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"என்னங்க, இப்படி கோவிச்சுகிறீங்க! 200 ரூபா அவன் கேட்டான். பூ, மொட்டுன்னு சொல்லி அனுப்பிச்சுட்டீங்களே!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":27,"printed_page":26}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d029","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அய்யய்யோ! சாந்தம்மா, கோவிச்சுக்காதே! சாந்தம்மா, நமக்கு இப்படி கோபம் வரக்கூடாது! அவன் செலவு பண்ணிடுவானே அதுக்காகப் பாத்தேன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":27,"printed_page":26}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d030","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"செலவழிச்சா என்ன! நம்பத் தவிற வேறு யாரு குடுப்பா?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":27,"printed_page":26}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d031","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"சம","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கோபிச்சுக்காதேன்னு சொன்னா கேக்க மாட்டேங்கிறியே; இந்தா எப்பவும் நாம சந்தோஷமா இருக்கணும்; கோபமே கூடாது! எங்க கொஞ்சம் சிரி!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":27,"printed_page":26}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"},{"id":"raja-rani-s011-d032","scene_id":"raja-rani-s011","scene_ordinal":11,"transition_audit_id":"T011","speaker_label":"சாந்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"சிரிக்க முடியாது!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":27,"printed_page":26}],"source_scene_file":"scene-011.md"}]}